* text=auto
# This one migration was applied with mixed EOL, and the core's `updates` row
# and applied_migrations.csv both record its exact bytes. `-text` stops
# `* text=auto` from normalising the committed blob to LF, so a fresh checkout
# reproduces the applied SHA1. Path-specific on purpose: no other SQL file needs
# it (GitHub #65/#70, ruling 2026-09-23).
mod-diablocraft/data/sql/db-world/updates/crafting_0003_crafting_tunables.sql -text
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
client-patch/*.MPQ filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.cmd text eol=crlf
